{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34187","headline":"素丝 · 陆龟蒙","name":"素丝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"园客丽独茧，诗人吟五緵。\n如何墨子泪，反以悲途穷。\n我意岂如是，愿参天地功。\n爲綫补君衮，爲弦系君桐。\n左右修阙职，宫商还古风。\n端然洁白心，可与神明通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}